 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The LORD spoke to Moses and Aaron",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring the swelling, rash, or bright spot to the priest",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hair has turned white, the sore is deep",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He examines the skin, declares him unclean",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If it looks shallow, the hair is not white",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Isolate the person for seven days",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Check again on the seventh day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If it has faded, he is clean",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wear torn clothes, let the hair hang down",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cover the upper lip, stand alone",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Cry out loud, \"Unclean! Unclean!\"",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Live outside the camp, in the dust and the sun",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If the disease covers head to foot",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And it has all turned white, he is clean",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if raw flesh appears on the skin",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The priest sees it, declares him unclean",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
